            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Only the most ruthless rise to the top and become ganglords.</p><hr /><h2>Gangsters</h2><p>Criminal guilds, crime families, protection rackets, and loan sharks are just a few of the many types of gangs in Absalom Station. Gangs are highly localized, predatory, and extremely territorial. Members join for different reasons, but most find that once they're in a gang, there's no easy way out.</p>\n<p>Gangsters always have hustles, criminal industries they use to make money, but most also operate protection rackets as a matter of course. Business owners within a gang's territory (or worse, in the overlapping territories of more than one gang) can expect to pay regularly or risk severe consequences.</p>",
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Starfinder Absalom Station"
            }
